# The panel's keys play notes (F3 up), at full breath; OCT- / OCT+ move them
wait 200
key 4 down
wait 30
expect top 57
expect gate 1
expect breath >98
expect level >5
expect litkeys 16
shot key_held.png
key 4 up
wait 300
expect gate 0
# a MIDI note over a held key plays at the breath that came (none here), not the key's full breath: a
# controller's stray note doesn't sound at full; letting it go, the key's note is back at full breath
key 4 down
wait 30
expect breath >98
midi 90 3D 40
wait 30
expect top 61
expect breath <2
midi 80 3D 00
wait 30
expect top 57
expect breath >98
key 4 up
wait 300
tap OCT+
expect par25 1
key 0 down
wait 20
expect top 65
key 0 up
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
expect par25 -1
tapkey 0
expect top 41
# no Key breath any more: the keys always play at full breath (they sense no pressure); SEQ is the Pitch pages
tap SEQ
expect view 10
expect knob1 Bend
# nothing on the screen is stale
wait 50
expect stale 0
